WEBVTT

00:01.467 --> 00:04.470
When you get a sec,
let me see that key again, wouldja?

00:06.555 --> 00:08.682
Go to the water fountain
with the turtle,

00:08.766 --> 00:10.267
then use the key.

00:12.561 --> 00:13.603
Don't tell me he…

00:15.689 --> 00:18.108
Thankful Death!

00:18.734 --> 00:22.028
Just the driver…
Looks like no one else is here.

00:26.200 --> 00:27.201
Presso!

00:27.243 --> 00:29.453
Looks like I got a fighter!

00:31.205 --> 00:33.874
<i>W-What the hell is this hook
doing under my skin?!</i>

00:34.124 --> 00:38.044
<i>That age accelerating asshole
brought a freakin' friend?</i>

00:49.640 --> 00:54.140
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

00:54.979 --> 00:58.482
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

01:00.234 --> 01:04.734
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

01:05.406 --> 01:09.243
<i>But I will never give in</i>

01:09.285 --> 01:13.785
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

01:21.088 --> 01:25.588
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

01:34.143 --> 01:38.643
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

01:40.149 --> 01:44.649
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

01:47.197 --> 01:50.366
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

01:50.409 --> 01:54.909
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

01:55.664 --> 02:00.164
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

02:11.847 --> 02:14.266
Big bro, where are you?!

02:13.474 --> 02:17.974
EPISODE 15
THANKFUL DEATH, PART 1

02:14.350 --> 02:16.018
Come on, cut it out…

02:16.185 --> 02:17.999
I know Bucciarati and
his buddies boarded this train!

02:19.521 --> 02:22.106
<i>But who the hell is
that tugging on my hook…</i>

02:22.191 --> 02:24.318
<i>no way could it be that girl Trish.</i>

02:24.860 --> 02:27.070
<i>No teenage girl could yank
this line with so much power.</i>

02:27.154 --> 02:29.364
<i>My hook dug into the left hand
of a human being.</i>

02:29.448 --> 02:31.533
<i>Their weight is 68 kilograms!</i>

02:31.950 --> 02:34.661
Time to reel this sucker in!

02:36.288 --> 02:37.914
Oh shit, shit, shit…

02:37.998 --> 02:42.085
The hook keeps burrowing
deeper and deeper!

02:43.379 --> 02:44.421
It's fast!

02:44.463 --> 02:46.673
It's shooting up my arm
like a heat-seeking missile!

02:51.845 --> 02:53.429
Th-This line…

02:54.890 --> 02:56.474
I snagged Mista!

02:56.558 --> 02:59.018
Someone shot at my line
with a gun!

02:59.728 --> 03:02.272
The dick with the gun
is Guido Mista!

03:02.648 --> 03:06.860
Well played,
but my line is indestructible!

03:07.027 --> 03:08.778
Now I wonder where
the reverberation

03:08.862 --> 03:10.572
from the bullet impact
will end up going?

03:10.739 --> 03:13.241
Let's reel you in for a look!

03:13.992 --> 03:16.411
I gotta rip this thing out
fast somehow!

03:19.123 --> 03:22.584
Miseria… This thing is gonna
burrow into my brain!

03:23.377 --> 03:24.795
Sonuvabitch!

03:27.339 --> 03:31.176
Six Bullets!
Pull this damn hook back now!

03:32.761 --> 03:35.680
This thing's strong!
It's taking us for a ride!

03:35.806 --> 03:38.600
The hook is stronger
than all of us!

03:38.892 --> 03:42.478
Frickin' A… I'm gonna have
to find this thing.

03:42.646 --> 03:44.648
Time for a little surgery!

03:46.608 --> 03:47.650
Find it!

03:47.693 --> 03:48.819
Find it!

03:49.069 --> 03:50.862
We need to track it down, boys…
Get it done!

03:50.946 --> 03:51.947
Find it!

03:54.742 --> 03:56.034
What was that?

03:56.118 --> 03:58.370
Was that Mista's shitty revolver?

03:58.662 --> 04:01.331
Who the hell are you
even shooting at?

04:01.415 --> 04:04.501
You trying to take out
one of these poor passengers?

04:04.918 --> 04:09.172
Or are ya trying to ferret me out
by playing sniper?

04:09.214 --> 04:10.924
Whatever, you're screwed!

04:11.049 --> 04:15.511
My hook is at the doorstep to
the innermost portion of your ear!

04:28.150 --> 04:32.650
Lower, guys, or we will never blast
that ice out of there!

04:34.656 --> 04:36.699
A little lower now, almost there!

04:36.825 --> 04:40.578
Keep movin, keep movin…
Now, blast away!

04:40.829 --> 04:42.705
There's the cold stuff
we've been looking for!

04:42.998 --> 04:45.917
Okay, ragazzi, shatter that shit!

04:56.845 --> 04:58.721
What do you think you're doing?!

05:00.140 --> 05:02.559
Of course that overgrown thumb
would be trying to cool himself.

05:02.768 --> 05:04.728
Now that's what you call
a one-track mind!

05:05.354 --> 05:06.355
Damn it!

05:06.396 --> 05:08.856
You idiot! The ice…

05:09.107 --> 05:11.651
- That's one pale ass pineapple head…
- My ice!

05:11.985 --> 05:14.070
Is this weird-looking cazzone…?

05:14.822 --> 05:15.739
It's him!

05:15.781 --> 05:18.283
This is the guy controlling
that freaky hook!

05:18.534 --> 05:21.245
That fishing-rod-looking thing
is his Stand!

05:21.328 --> 05:22.829
<i>R-Run for it!</i>

05:23.247 --> 05:25.457
<i>I need ice…
I gotta get some ice</i>

05:25.541 --> 05:27.584
<i>or big bro's age accelerator's
gonna kill me too!</i>

05:29.211 --> 05:31.421
H-Help me…

05:31.672 --> 05:34.257
Move it, you crusty old geezer!

05:34.299 --> 05:36.092
Get your rotting hands off m—

05:36.218 --> 05:40.597
I feel so heavy and weak…
All I want to do is sleep…

05:40.639 --> 05:44.100
I ordered a great big juicy steak,

05:44.142 --> 05:46.435
and now, I don't even have
the energy to enjoy it…

05:46.520 --> 05:48.772
Don't touch me, freak!

05:50.941 --> 05:53.276
Woohoo! His hand is toast!

05:53.443 --> 05:54.819
Call Mista over here now!

05:55.195 --> 05:57.363
- Quick, over here, Mista!
- Mista!

06:00.242 --> 06:02.118
Mista, over here!

06:02.327 --> 06:03.911
We got the user!

06:23.932 --> 06:27.018
Six Bullets, everyone,
back to your stations.

06:39.907 --> 06:42.326
Whether or not you decide
to shoot me back an answer,

06:42.910 --> 06:46.997
I'm still gonna ask you
one simple, straightforward…

06:47.080 --> 06:49.207
elementary question.

06:50.375 --> 06:54.875
If you can't muster up
a response within two seconds,

06:55.047 --> 06:57.883
I'm gonna take aim at your peepers
and shoot hot lead into your face,

06:57.966 --> 06:59.217
a bullet for each eye ball.

06:59.927 --> 07:03.931
It's uno then due,
that's all my patience will last.

07:03.972 --> 07:05.014
Capito?

07:05.140 --> 07:06.808
Okie dokie,
now for the big interview.

07:08.060 --> 07:11.063
Where the hell is
your life-robbing companion hiding?

07:12.606 --> 07:13.607
Uno…

07:13.649 --> 07:16.777
Shit, I don't know…
I've been looking for him too!

07:17.152 --> 07:19.237
Due… Okay, drop dead.

07:19.363 --> 07:23.325
Please, I need your help…

07:23.492 --> 07:26.995
Juicy, marbled steak was
always my favorite,

07:27.162 --> 07:28.663
- but now the thought of it
- Hey! Move aside,

07:28.705 --> 07:29.831
- makes me sick…
- I promise you,

07:29.873 --> 07:31.457
you'll be craving
a steak again in no time!

07:31.500 --> 07:34.211
No, I'm afraid the end
is near, my boy…

07:34.670 --> 07:38.048
For you that is, dear Mista.

07:38.340 --> 07:40.300
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

07:46.515 --> 07:48.934
Thankful Death…

07:49.226 --> 07:51.728
Huh? W-What?

07:51.895 --> 07:54.397
W-Wait! Are you…

07:54.690 --> 07:57.234
Miseria!

08:01.029 --> 08:04.157
The death sets in fast
with a touch.

08:04.199 --> 08:06.618
It floods the body…

08:06.910 --> 08:10.955
That's what happens when
Thankful Death caresses you.

08:11.707 --> 08:13.750
B-Bullets…

08:14.001 --> 08:18.501
<i>Th-This speed… Shit…</i>

08:24.052 --> 08:26.179
I-Is that you, big bro?

08:26.221 --> 08:27.680
Are you my big bro?!

08:28.724 --> 08:31.518
You had me completely fooled!

08:31.601 --> 08:33.978
Y-You were there the whole time?

08:34.312 --> 08:37.523
You attacked your own body
with your powers

08:37.566 --> 08:39.943
just to blend in with
the other passengers…

08:45.449 --> 08:48.452
Big bro, big bro Prosciutto,

08:48.535 --> 08:50.453
you always impress me a lot,
big bro.

08:54.416 --> 08:56.751
- Whadja do that for…?
- You bumbling idiot a!

08:56.793 --> 08:59.504
- Why're you so mad at me?!
- What the hell was that?! Huh?!

09:00.797 --> 09:03.549
How was I supposed to know
he would shoot at the ice?!

09:03.592 --> 09:05.468
There was nothing I could've done!

09:05.510 --> 09:07.345
You still don't get it?

09:07.429 --> 09:09.305
You're a damn mammoni,
you know that?!

09:09.347 --> 09:12.099
I don't wanna be hit anymore,
big bro!

09:13.518 --> 09:16.437
Listen, you wanna know
why I'm pissed?

09:16.480 --> 09:18.899
It's 'cause you have
such a weak spirit, Pesci!

09:19.399 --> 09:22.819
The bastard blasted your ice,

09:22.903 --> 09:25.238
and now, you're in shock.
It happens.

09:25.280 --> 09:27.532
I'm speeding toward death
as we speak.

09:27.616 --> 09:29.409
This ain't a walk
in the park for me.

09:29.743 --> 09:32.954
But I promise you
no one else from the team,

09:32.996 --> 09:36.541
would have ever
called back their Stand

09:36.625 --> 09:38.543
at the moment of truth
with the enemy!

09:38.794 --> 09:40.045
Not if their arm was blown off,

09:40.128 --> 09:41.921
and not if their leg was
ripped from their body!

09:42.130 --> 09:45.007
You're a damn mammoni, Pesci.

09:45.050 --> 09:47.886
You practically pissed yourself
like a sniveling wimp.

09:48.053 --> 09:49.804
It's not about the ice.

09:49.846 --> 09:53.474
Deep down in your heart of hearts,
terror took hold.

09:53.809 --> 09:56.353
Man up pronto, Pesci.

09:56.436 --> 09:59.522
'Cause if you can't, glory will
forever be beyond our reach.

09:59.564 --> 10:01.983
Bucciarati and his sidekicks
will emerge victorious.

10:02.109 --> 10:04.528
And one last thing for you
to mull over…

10:04.820 --> 10:09.320
We are different, we are not
a gang of ass-kissing losers

10:10.325 --> 10:14.825
who indulge in empty threats
and self-coddling compliments.

10:19.835 --> 10:22.754
The moment we visualize
the death of our enemy,

10:23.630 --> 10:27.175
their murder is already realized!

10:37.561 --> 10:39.145
Let's go, Pesci.

10:39.729 --> 10:41.063
Here, have some ice.

10:42.023 --> 10:43.065
Now you were saying something

10:43.150 --> 10:47.650
about sensing another soul
in the driver's car, right?

10:48.321 --> 10:50.740
I don't have a frickin' clue how,

10:51.032 --> 10:53.993
but that little harlot
is hiding in that car!

10:59.499 --> 11:01.542
PROSCIUTTO
THANKFUL DEATH

11:10.177 --> 11:12.846
Don't worry about Narancia!

11:15.307 --> 11:18.226
The ice in the glass is for you!

11:19.269 --> 11:21.354
Just focus on lowering
your body temperature.

11:21.646 --> 11:24.482
It's going to take more than
a few minutes in front of a fan

11:24.566 --> 11:26.901
with a damp towel
to lower body temperature.

11:27.652 --> 11:30.321
The only thing that
will do it is ice.

11:30.906 --> 11:34.200
At this rate,
he'll be the first to die.

11:34.367 --> 11:36.243
We all accepted the boss's mission,

11:36.286 --> 11:38.997
knowing full well
the dangers involved.

11:39.414 --> 11:42.625
Your own well-being is paramount.

11:43.168 --> 11:44.878
Safeguarding you is our duty.

11:45.503 --> 11:48.797
Needless to say, you brought
none of this onto yourself.

11:49.257 --> 11:52.218
I promise you,
this age-accelerating Stand…

11:52.928 --> 11:54.888
…will have met
his match with Mista.

11:55.138 --> 11:58.224
He'll pull through…
he'll settle this… I know it.

11:59.100 --> 12:00.142
Mista…

12:14.616 --> 12:18.786
<i>Where and how are they hiding?</i>

12:19.287 --> 12:20.705
<i>It's all starting to make sense.</i>

12:23.833 --> 12:27.837
<i>I need to begin thinking about
the world in four dimensions.</i>

12:28.463 --> 12:31.466
<i>Bucciarati picked up
a certain something</i>

12:31.508 --> 12:33.426
<i>sent by the boss at the binario.</i>

12:33.510 --> 12:36.888
<i>That's it. That's the object of
mystery I have to find in here.</i>

12:38.848 --> 12:40.015
Hey, Pesci.

12:40.976 --> 12:45.476
What do you think it was that
you felt in this car a while ago?

12:46.273 --> 12:47.774
You don't feel it now?

12:48.149 --> 12:51.735
It's the funniest thing, big bro…

12:52.362 --> 12:55.031
I wish you wouldn't put
so much pressure on me.

12:55.198 --> 12:56.782
I just don't have your sense.

12:56.992 --> 13:00.245
Pesci, Pesci, Pesci, Pesci…

13:00.328 --> 13:03.080
I have complete faith
in your abilities.

13:03.290 --> 13:06.459
I got angry with you
back there for a reason.

13:06.543 --> 13:08.545
You need self confidence.

13:08.670 --> 13:13.170
If you can just snap out of it,
I know you will be unbeatable.

13:15.135 --> 13:16.136
Now come on.

13:16.720 --> 13:21.220
That feeling you had
is extremely important.

13:21.933 --> 13:24.435
It's your time to shine, Pesci.

13:25.645 --> 13:29.732
Have faith and believe in yourself,
believe in your amazing power.

13:29.816 --> 13:31.234
You, you think?

13:31.276 --> 13:32.568
Of course!

13:32.652 --> 13:36.197
Now try to think back…
You can tell me anything.

13:36.364 --> 13:38.908
Did anything seem strange?

13:39.159 --> 13:41.911
Like a strange, dark object?

13:42.078 --> 13:45.915
Huh? A dark object?

13:46.333 --> 13:47.667
That's it, big bro!

13:47.709 --> 13:50.920
I was going to look under the seat!

13:51.046 --> 13:53.089
Something caught my eye!

13:59.179 --> 14:01.890
S-Sorry… I guess it was in my head.

14:02.557 --> 14:04.350
See, I knew I'd mess this up…

14:04.392 --> 14:08.892
- My intuition totally sucks.
- No, I think you're on to something.

14:10.398 --> 14:11.524
What was that?!

14:11.566 --> 14:13.192
I'm proud of you, Pesci.

14:13.735 --> 14:15.278
Our mystery is no more.

14:15.403 --> 14:18.114
You single-handedly led
yours truly to the light.

14:18.990 --> 14:20.950
B-Bro? W-What are you…?

14:21.034 --> 14:23.786
- Why the hell would there be
- I'm not following at all.

14:23.870 --> 14:26.289
Animal shit on a train
under a seat?

14:27.332 --> 14:29.375
This didn't come from a rat.

14:29.417 --> 14:30.960
The thing would be long dead.

14:31.002 --> 14:33.462
Their life spans are
shorter than their shit.

14:33.588 --> 14:37.592
It's fresh. Whatever did this,
did it a few minutes ago.

14:37.842 --> 14:40.803
Wondering what this all means?

14:41.054 --> 14:44.932
Human beings aren't the
only ones with Stands.

14:45.225 --> 14:47.101
And that means…

14:47.435 --> 14:49.937
We've got an animal
hiding in the shadows!

14:50.021 --> 14:51.939
Thankful Death!

14:55.944 --> 14:58.154
W-What the hell is that?!

14:58.279 --> 15:00.990
I-It's a turtle? That's crazy!

15:01.282 --> 15:03.492
We found our girl. It's Trish!

15:03.576 --> 15:05.077
I can see the others, too!

15:05.620 --> 15:07.913
Just as planned, they're passing
from their golden years

15:07.956 --> 15:09.457
to eternal slumber,
except for Trish!

15:09.833 --> 15:10.959
The moment has arrived!

15:11.126 --> 15:14.212
This turtle and his cargo are going
to get an extra dose of aging!

15:14.379 --> 15:16.422
Thankful Death!

15:16.548 --> 15:18.007
Wait a sec, Bro!

15:19.300 --> 15:23.178
Isn't there… one guy missing?

15:24.305 --> 15:27.224
There's someone missing in there!

15:46.286 --> 15:50.206
Mista! You have to get up!

15:50.248 --> 15:54.748
Here, this last hunk of ice
will make you feel all better!

15:57.338 --> 16:01.133
Who knows, maybe it's because
I'm always expecting the worse,

16:01.593 --> 16:04.596
or maybe I've got a guardian angel…

16:05.430 --> 16:09.642
Storing that chunk of ice
under my hat

16:09.684 --> 16:12.853
was the best decision
I've ever made…

16:12.979 --> 16:14.730
Number Five…

16:14.772 --> 16:19.272
If you hadn't been able to
turn back the hands of time…

16:22.489 --> 16:26.117
If you hadn't stopped
those bullets…

16:26.201 --> 16:27.785
all three of them.

16:29.370 --> 16:33.870
Number Five…
I have one more favor to ask…

16:34.167 --> 16:36.085
If you're thinking of sending
one of us to Bucciarati,

16:36.169 --> 16:40.256
Number Six is revived
and already on his way!

16:40.548 --> 16:43.300
He's got the ice
from your pocket,

16:43.384 --> 16:47.679
he's gonna tell 'em those two
are closing in on the turtle!

16:47.889 --> 16:52.389
That's good enough for me…
I don't need that stuff now…

16:57.565 --> 16:58.774
or ever…

16:59.067 --> 17:00.777
Mista!

17:03.530 --> 17:05.448
It's Bucciarati, Bro!

17:05.573 --> 17:08.367
Bucciarati's the one missing!

17:08.868 --> 17:10.911
Forget about Bucciarati!

17:11.079 --> 17:13.539
All that matters is that
the girl is alive and in our hands!

17:13.790 --> 17:15.917
Thankful Death!

17:16.918 --> 17:18.544
What the hell?!

17:19.128 --> 17:20.796
Impressive instincts…

17:20.838 --> 17:23.131
I have to say, you're pretty light
on your feet too.

17:23.466 --> 17:25.593
So I off this coglione,
and we're all good, right?

17:25.885 --> 17:27.803
The guy dressed in black, yes!

17:27.887 --> 17:29.722
You got it, Bucciarati!

17:29.764 --> 17:33.350
Knock this bastard out,
and the aging will be reversed!

17:33.810 --> 17:36.813
<i>What the hell is
Mista's Stand doing here?!</i>

17:37.021 --> 17:41.521
<i>I emptied my freakin' gun
into your skull…</i>

17:43.111 --> 17:45.446
<i>How could that thing
have ice in here?!</i>

17:45.572 --> 17:47.448
Don't let it touch you!

17:47.782 --> 17:50.826
His touch will make you age
even faster!

17:53.621 --> 17:55.122
Get 'em!

18:05.883 --> 18:07.843
H-He's fast…

18:11.639 --> 18:13.140
Bro!

18:13.349 --> 18:14.850
Keep your eyes on
the damn prize!

18:14.934 --> 18:16.852
Just take care of the fools
in the turtle!

18:17.645 --> 18:21.523
Just do it… Put these weevils
out of commission for good.

18:31.743 --> 18:34.412
I'm very surprised, Bucciarati?

18:35.538 --> 18:39.041
To think that Mista went through
all that trouble to tip you off…

18:39.292 --> 18:41.377
Knocking off me
and protecting the girl,

18:41.461 --> 18:43.337
regardless of the human cost…

18:43.713 --> 18:46.048
Isn't that your mission?

18:46.924 --> 18:50.052
You failed your famiglia…
Die!

18:53.097 --> 18:54.098
What?!

19:02.899 --> 19:04.734
I will fulfill my mission.

19:05.401 --> 19:07.027
I will save my famiglia.

19:07.278 --> 19:11.778
If all it is is facing you,
then it's gioco da ragazzi.

19:12.825 --> 19:14.409
It's fast…

19:15.620 --> 19:18.414
It's got speed for sure…

19:19.540 --> 19:24.040
Your… Zipper Man, was it?

19:25.380 --> 19:27.006
There's no question,

19:27.048 --> 19:29.467
you are naturally endowed
with the gift of speed…

19:29.759 --> 19:32.762
But you still don't know
the first thing

19:32.804 --> 19:35.640
about using it, Bucciarati!

19:39.143 --> 19:43.063
Guess it's obvious
I'm a bit short of breath…

19:46.359 --> 19:49.403
But the same goes for you,
Bucciarati.

19:49.612 --> 19:54.112
That tends to happen, you know,

19:54.283 --> 19:57.619
when one uses their Stand
at full bore.

19:57.745 --> 20:00.330
Clearly,
that hadn't entered your mind

20:00.415 --> 20:02.875
when you were acting
at maximum speed.

20:02.917 --> 20:04.960
Of course,
your rapid aging has continued,

20:05.044 --> 20:06.879
even as you gawk at me now!

20:08.756 --> 20:13.256
The greater the horsepower,
the hotter the engine!

20:14.011 --> 20:16.638
I'm talking calories for us.

20:16.723 --> 20:20.935
You have a modicum of intelligence,
I'm sure you can follow…

20:21.102 --> 20:24.313
What do you think will happen
when the body heats up!

20:27.942 --> 20:29.985
B-Bucciarati!

20:30.945 --> 20:34.657
The ice isn't working anymore!

20:34.949 --> 20:37.701
So what now, tough guy?

20:37.785 --> 20:42.285
This zipper you gave me
is starting to close.

20:42.623 --> 20:45.542
The one on my chin is long gone.

20:45.626 --> 20:46.918
What's wrong?

20:47.044 --> 20:49.463
Feeling a bit stiff and
a bit tuckered out now…

20:51.340 --> 20:53.175
Zipper Man!

20:54.010 --> 20:58.055
So predictable…
Wake up, Bucciarati!

21:00.141 --> 21:03.269
Gotcha… Consider yourselves ready
for the crematorium!

21:03.436 --> 21:06.147
The girl, on the other hand,
belongs to us!

21:06.189 --> 21:07.857
I knew exactly what would happen

21:07.899 --> 21:10.109
with an increase
in body temperature.

21:11.319 --> 21:13.863
I also knew I could be captured
at any moment.

21:13.988 --> 21:15.990
I will carry out my mission.

21:16.115 --> 21:17.491
I will protect my crew.

21:18.034 --> 21:22.534
A capo must be prepared for both…
It's the burden of responsibility.

21:23.456 --> 21:24.957
Can you take the challenge?

21:26.501 --> 21:27.835
I've never been more ready.

21:28.169 --> 21:29.211
Wha—?

21:29.670 --> 21:31.046
Y-You can't mean…

21:31.172 --> 21:33.549
You bastard! You can't be serious!

21:33.591 --> 21:35.926
Both are really quite doable,

21:36.427 --> 21:39.012
as long as I get you off
this maledetto treno.

21:39.639 --> 21:41.432
By breaking
your aging spell of death,

21:41.516 --> 21:43.142
I will revive my famiglia.

21:43.476 --> 21:44.768
I will protect Trish!

21:44.852 --> 21:48.313
You bastardo,
you're insane, let me go!

21:48.523 --> 21:50.816
The ground is speeding under us
at a hundred and fifty km an hour!

21:50.858 --> 21:53.902
Aspeta, you, sir,
are the one who grabbed me.

21:59.492 --> 22:03.992
You want to die… cazzone?!

23:37.965 --> 23:42.010
EPISODE 16
THANKFUL DEATH, PART 2
